	old := `{"format":1,"devices":{"d1":{"version":"v1","online":false,"revision":0,"desired":{},"reported":{},"lastSeq":0}},"campaigns":{"cmp-1":{"id":"cmp-1","operator":"alice","target":"v2","createdAt":"2026-10-02T12:00:00Z","batchSize":1,"windowStart":"2026-10-02T12:00:00Z","windowEnd":"2026-10-02T13:00:00Z","deadline":"2026-10-02T14:00:00Z","lastTime":"2026-10-02T12:00:00Z","status":"running","ended":false,"devices":[{"deviceId":"d1","batch":0,"status":"pending","phase":"download","download":{"id":"cmp-1:d1:download"},"install":{"id":"cmp-1:d1:install"}}]}}}`
	if err := os.WriteFile(filepath.Join(dir, storeFileName), []byte(old), 0o644); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
